      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was thinking like below.\n\nRVP\u0027s which supports external shared flash will define CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_SHARED_SPI_FLASH and use API\u0027s implemented under this.\nThis in a way can be extended to CEP\u0027s too.\n\nRest of the platforms(RVP\u0027s currently) which uses EC internal flash will only do the init of this GPIO under board_init().\nThis code is already part of the ML code. Hence i have marked board_init() under NOT define of the CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_SHARED_SPI_FLASH. \nI think init is only RVP specific implementation and may vary for CEP\u0027s depending on CEP designs for shared flash access.",
